    "blocks": [
      {
        "id": "p1",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "Electricity is all around us. It runs in "
          },
          {
            "t": "vocab",
            "v": "wires",
            "ref": "v-wire"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " and is not very easy to see. It is a form of "
          },
          {
            "t": "vocab",
            "v": "energy",
            "ref": "v-energy"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " that can give things the ability to move and work."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "p2",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "Electricity is useful. Look around in your home. A fan "
          },
          {
            "t": "gloss",
            "v": "converts",
            "zh": "转换"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " electrical energy into "
          },
          {
            "t": "gloss",
            "v": "kinetic energy",
            "zh": "动能"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " of its "
          },
          {
            "t": "gloss",
            "v": "fan blades",
            "zh": "叶片"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": ". That way, you can get cool air! A "
          },
          {
            "t": "gloss",
            "v": "toaster",
            "zh": "烤面包机"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " converts electricity into "
          },
          {
            "t": "vocab",
            "v": "heat",
            "ref": "v-heat"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " to turn bread into "
          },
          {
            "t": "vocab",
            "v": "toast",
            "ref": "v-toast"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": ". Now you can enjoy your warm breakfast!"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "p3",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "Electricity is dangerous. So be careful when using it. "
          },
          {
            "t": "gloss",
            "v": "Beware of",
            "zh": "当心"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " "
          },
          {
            "t": "gloss",
            "v": "conductors",
            "zh": "导体"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "! They let electricity pass through them easily. Many "
          },
          {
            "t": "vocab",
            "v": "metals",
            "ref": "v-metal"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " are good conductors. Touching a conductor in a "
          },
          {
            "t": "gloss",
            "v": "circuit",
            "zh": "电路"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " is dangerous, because you may get an "
          },
          {
            "t": "gloss",
            "v": "electric shock",
            "zh": "触电"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": ". Ouch!"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "p4",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "Plastic, wood, glass and "
          },
          {
            "t": "gloss",
            "v": "rubber",
            "zh": "橡胶"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " do not let electricity "
          },
          {
            "t": "gloss",
            "v": "flow",
            "zh": "流"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " through them. They are known as "
          },
          {
            "t": "gloss",
            "v": "insulators",
            "zh": "绝缘体"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": ". That’s why wires are "
          },
          {
            "t": "gloss",
            "v": "wrapped",
            "zh": "包裹"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " in plastic. People won’t get shocked if they touch a wire."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "i1",
        "type": "imageRef",
